<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-28T13:18:38.484Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:18:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have intensified attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking the Ras Tanura oil refinery and prompting Saudi air defenses to intercept missiles over the capital, while also firing a second missile at Yemen’s Aden airport and urging its evacuation as fighting escalates. Gulf states are negotiating a multipart peace deal to prevent a renewed US-Iran war, and Egypt’s parliament has approved military support for Saudi Arabia. Russian satellites are being used to guide Houthi strikes on Saudi targets. These actions have contributed to higher oil prices. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/28/gulf-states-multipart-peace-deal-avert-renewal-us-iran-war&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPQXVwb1hReGQzckI4V3JzZXRqejJvSkxYenk2QmlSQlVVSFp3SDhod2dVeGZUYTliUUdOcllVaUlUelBYblBBVVVCNURkdk5ZelNHbkw4cEJqNmZrdjZKOVdncGUwZFdFMXJXb19ETWRJOTRkSWtRcUdVY3pXTml0TmxBdnNJSGtnX21TSElhd0R5a1F6UHY3TTVMcEtwazQ4SEl6Z2x2d0lVUTVkRFV3M1FoY2R6eW1fS1RWT0JaMjN6TUNMU3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQQWktallhRGk5Y3p6WmxxWktmYm5sVm5fUlRlWmE3S0t4ZE05QzNxRGFFanQ3c3pTSHpjZ1IzcDY2RUlSSlhaTjFENVExUzJ2Q0UxOGxieGlWZDVadnVsd3N0M0dBWjIxYUcwUGNfQlNVQW0wQjYyUFVubDgwY2JZV3BKa3JHRExXNW00T3lRWDVxLUJwRWVLay1HUjVVcU5wTU5xWlY5dGFxSFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOSlpYejlRTmd1MFprTGxzTHhIQi1taDhJVkMtTThYN1Y5UktONWZxcVM5TEJ2Sy1Jd25QZXFCem5uNDkzOGU3Z0NONzE1V0ZPT2E2QlJTdjZreDg0eXA5Z21MandpYmI3azQ5Q0h4azVTdHpYQnVQVGdYR3pEajBid0QtT0taZl9OVktOSUhIWjl6eGdqYlJ5RFZOd3p1LVRkVjVCVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar